      {
        "type": "label",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "A Psalm or Song for the sons of Korah."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          1
        ],
        "lines": [
          "His foundation is in the holy mountains."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          2
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The LORD loveth the gates of Zion more than all the dwellings of Jacob."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          3
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Glorious things are spoken of thee,",
          "O city of God."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "label",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Selah."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          4
        ],
        "lines": [
          "I will make mention of Rahab and Babylon to them that know me:",
          "Behold Philistia, and Tyre, with Ethiopia;",
          "This man was born there."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          5
        ],
        "lines": [
          "And of Zion it shall be said, This and that man was born in her:",
          "And the highest himself shall establish her."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          6
        ],
        "lines": [
          "The LORD shall count, when he writeth up the people,",
          "That this man was born there."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "label",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "Selah."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          7
        ],
        "lines": [
          "As well the singers as the players on instruments shall be there:",
          "All my springs are in thee."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      }
    ]
